== Variegations ==
[[File:Pink_variegated_begonia_maculata.jpg|thumb|Single leaf close-up of the pink variegated begonia maculata]]
The pink [[Variegation|variegated]] Begonia Maculata is a rare variegation, with pastel pink distributed in random patterns on the dark green leaves. <ref>{{Cite web |last=Ford |first=Christiana |date=2025-07-08 |title=Detroit's Rare Plant Fairy celebrates five years growing from pandemic bedroom startup to plant powerhouse |url=https://www.wxyz.com/news/positively-detroit/detroits-rare-plant-fairy-celebrates-five-years-growing-from-pandemic-bedroom-startup-to-plant-powerhouse |access-date=2026-08-31 |website=WXYZ 7 News Detroit |language=en}}</ref>

The pink variegation is becoming more widely available as this plant is easy to [[propagate]]. <ref>{{Cite web |title=Begonia Snowcap Variegated |url=https://me-greeneryexport.com/product/begonia-maculata-variegated/ |access-date=2026-08-31 |language=en-US}}</ref> <ref>{{Cite web |date=2026-08-30 |title=How to Successfully Propagate Begonia Maculata: Easy Guide |url=https://www.longfield-gardens.com/blogs/begonia-care/how-to-propagate-begonia-maculata-successfully |access-date=2026-08-31 |website=Longfield Gardens |language=en}}</ref>

